 	/*
-	 * Tachometer-only channel: second pump header (PUMP_SYS Fan 2 in BIOS).
-	 * 0x144 is unused in this mapping since the system fans moved to
-	 * 0x154-0x15E. No PWM control path has been verified for it, so
-	 * reg_pwm/reg_pwm_write are left at 0 and no pwm attribute is created.
+	 * Tachometer-only channel. 0x144 is unused in this mapping since the
+	 * system fans moved to 0x154-0x15E. No PWM control path has been
+	 * verified for it, so reg_pwm/reg_pwm_write are left at 0 and no pwm
+	 * attribute is created.
+	 *
+	 * The register is board-specific: on the MEG Z890 GODLIKE it is the
+	 * second pump header, and on the MSI PRO X870-P WIFI it is the EZ Conn
+	 * header. A board that needs a different one sets fan9_reg_rpm in its
